<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-WESTERN SAMOA BEAT OXFORD UNIVERSITY 58-27.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-WESTERN SAMOA BEAT OXFORD UNIVERSITY 58-27.</headline>
<dateline>OXFORD, England 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Samoa beat Oxford University 58-27 (halftime 18-13) in a rugby union tour match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Oxford University - Tries: Chris Smart, James Averis, penalty try. Conversion: Averis (3). Penalties: James Averis (2).</p>
<p>Western Samoa - Tries: Mark Fatialofa (2), Veli Patu (2), Afao So'oalo, Filip Toala, Kalolo Toleafoa, George Leaupepe.   </p>
<p>Conversions: Fa'Avaivai Tanoi (6). Penalties: Tanoai (2).</p>
